  Good channels to search on YouTube:                                                                                                                              
  - Java Brains — deep Spring/Spring Boot concepts
  - TechPrimers — microservices, system design                                                                                                                     
  - Defog Tech — Java internals, concurrency                                                                                                                     
  - Spring Developer (official Spring channel)                                                                                                                     
  - in28minutes — Spring Boot end-to-end                                                                                                                           
  - Amigoscode — Spring Boot practical                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                   
  Key topics to focus on for senior/lead level:                                                                                                                    
  - Spring Boot internals (auto-configuration, bean lifecycle)                                                                                                   
  - Microservices patterns (Circuit Breaker, Saga, CQRS)                                                                                                           
  - Spring Security (JWT, OAuth2)                                                                                                                                
  - JVM tuning, GC strategies                                                                                                                                      
  - Reactive programming (WebFlux)                                                                                                                                 
  - Database transactions, distributed transactions                                                                                                                
  - Kafka/messaging integration                                                                                                                                    
  - Design patterns in Spring context                                                                                                                              
  - Observability (Micrometer, distributed tracing)        

